Max: Gradually.

5
00:00:06.997 --> 00:00:08.431
I haven't done spring cleaning

6
00:00:08.465 --> 00:00:09.832
in the rustbucket since I got

7
00:00:09.866 --> 00:00:10.232
her.

8
